  "persona": "",
  "subject": "a young line worker at a Taichung bicycle factory who loses every lunch-hour table-tennis game beside the forklifts to Uncle Hok, a 61-year-old forklift driver who holds his bat like a pen and chops everything back without moving his feet, with the workers betting their Yakult, until at five to one he wins a single game 11-9 and Uncle Hok says tomorrow he'll try",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien liquid drum and bass. A fast rolling two-step breakbeat with crisp ghost-note snares and a ticking ride cymbal; a deep, round sub bass gliding under the chords; warm Rhodes electric piano chords; a bright plucked synth riff bouncing like a ping-pong ball, with a short Amen-break fill into each chorus. Clean, wide, punchy club mix with the voice riding on top. A bright, quick male tenor singing half-time phrases over the double-time drums, with a group shout on the chorus score lines. 174 BPM, F minor. Breathless, cocky and laughing at himself. No trap hi-hats, no dubstep wobble, no autotune, no rap verse, no EDM festival drop, no neurofunk reese bass.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n臺中的鐵馬工廠 中晝十二點\n便當 三喙就扒了\n堆高機邊仔 一塊舊球桌\n阿福伯 早就徛佇對面\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊提球拍 若咧提筆\n六十一歲 毋捌走一步\n\n[Chorus]\n我殺 伊削\n球 轉甲若干樂\n十一比三 閣輸一盤\n養樂多 閣愛予伊\n\n[Verse]\n我暗時 對壁拍三禮拜\n壁 予我拍甲落漆\n今仔日 換一塊新的膠皮\n阿福伯 看一下 笑一聲\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n同事 坐佇堆高機頂\n一人一罐養樂多 咧輸贏\n\n[Chorus]\n我殺 伊削\n球 轉甲若干樂\n十一比七 差一屑仔\n賭我贏的 攏咧哀\n\n[Verse]\n十二點五十五 最後一盤\n十比九 規間工廠恬恬\n伊的球 摸著網仔才過來\n我規身軀 仆落去救\n\n[Bridge]\n球 跳一下 過網\n阿福伯 頭一擺 走一步\n猶是 慢一屑仔\n\n[Chorus]\n我殺 伊削\n球 轉甲若干樂\n十一比九 我贏一盤\n阿福伯的養樂多 換我啉\n\n[Outro]\n伊講 明仔載 伊欲認真",
